## Summary

US-003 is complete. Here's what was implemented:

### Acceptance Criteria Status

- **`/gas/scheduling-dashboard` supports creating new daily plans directly** — Clicking "Programar" on any unit row opens a drawer with the full `DailyEntryForm` (equipment ON/OFF toggles, atomizer hours, observations, QDP auto-calculation). The entry is saved via `POST /gas/units/:unitId/entries` which auto-creates the `GasDailyPlan`.

- **Equipment ON/OFF toggle integrated with auto QDP calculation** — The drawer reuses the existing `DailyEntryForm` component which has equipment switches and real-time QDP preview (from US-001).

- **Submit/approve workflow works from within the dashboard** — New server endpoints (`POST /gas/daily-plans/:planId/submit` and `/approve`) plus action buttons (Submeter, Aprovar, Rejeitar) in each row. Workflow status shown as color-coded badges (Rascunho → Aguardando Aprovação → Aprovado/Rejeitado).

- **Date picker allows navigating to any day** — Already present (prev/next day buttons, calendar popup, "Hoje" button).

- **Shows all units with their QDP values for the selected date** — Table displays all active units with QDP column, workflow status, and summary cards (Total, Programado, Pendente, Submetido, Aprovado).

- **Components in `apps/web/src/features/scheduling-dashboard/` updated with entry capabilities** — Provider extended with drawer state, new entry drawer component, columns updated with workflow column and action buttons, table updated with workflow mutations.

